---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Advisory for Investors & Buyers"
  description="ESG risk assessment, due diligence and traceability verification for capital and buyers entering ASM value chains."
>
  <section class="section service-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/#what-we-do">&larr; What We Do</a></p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Advisory for Investors &amp; Buyers</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal">
        Entering or sourcing from artisanal and small-scale mining brings
        real opportunity, and real risk. We help investors and buyers see
        both clearly before they commit.
      </p>

      <div class="body-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>What this covers</h2>
          <p>
            ESG and human rights risk assessments across a mine site or
            supply chain, due diligence on sourcing claims, and evaluation
            of an operation&rsquo;s readiness for formal buyers or
            investment. Our blockchain-based traceability approach verifies
            origin and chain of custody from mine to market.
          </p>
          <p>
            We can also assess a prospective ASM partner directly:
            governance, safety practice, community relationships and
            environmental exposure, before capital or a purchasing
            agreement is committed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <p>
            Our assessments draw on direct experience running an ASM
            operation ourselves, which shapes what we look for and how we
            weigh it. Findings are documented clearly enough to support an
            investment committee or a buyer&rsquo;s compliance process.
          </p>
          <p>
            Where gaps exist, we can also advise the mining partner
            directly on closing them, so a promising relationship has a
            practical path forward instead of a stalled one.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/contact">Talk to us about a project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .body-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta-row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .body-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
